(6658398, 995710, 103032, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this.  I like that it doesn''t look "posed"; has a very genuine capture of the moment.  Like how all the elements are "highlighted"; the dog, the master, and the stick (even though its in silhouette).  I like the b&amp;w processing, really focuses the attention on the dog and master.  I''m gonna go on a limb and say this has the feel of a jagar, nixter, or bspurgeon quality image.<br/>Just started, but already my favorite.</td>', 'Love everything about this.  I like that it doesn''t look "posed"; has a very genuine capture of the moment.  Like how all the elements are "highlighted"; the dog, the master, and the stick (even though its in silhouette).  I like the b&w processing, really focuses the attention on the dog and master.  I''m gonna go on a limb and say this has the feel of a jagar, nixter, or bspurgeon quality image.Just started, but already my favorite.', '2012-01-30 00:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
