(6658646, 995752, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in this challenge.  Really meets the challenge well.  Shows both human and pet interacting.  Good white balance on the snow.  Hope to see this ribbon.</td>', 'This is my favorite in this challenge.  Really meets the challenge well.  Shows both human and pet interacting.  Good white balance on the snow.  Hope to see this ribbon.', '2012-01-30 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
