(6658661, 995719, 142833, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely cat, and the hand on its back shows the owners care for the animal. <br/> <br/>Consider if an angle that allowed the viewer to experience the woman''s facial expression here might have conveyed the emotion more.</td>', 'It is a lovely cat, and the hand on its back shows the owners care for the animal.  Consider if an angle that allowed the viewer to experience the woman''s facial expression here might have conveyed the emotion more.', '2012-01-30 08:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658662, 995835, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the toning on this monochrome.</td>', 'I like the toning on this monochrome.', '2012-01-30 08:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658666, 995832, 142833, '<td valign="top">What a whimsical bizarre photo, I like it. :)</td>', 'What a whimsical bizarre photo, I like it. :)', '2012-01-30 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658667, 995831, 142833, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice shot. I get a subtle mix of emotion from this rider, love but also some fear, like the horse might be skittish and the rider is worried it''ll do something unpredictable.<br/> <br/>If I had one constructive comment, it''d have been to include the horses eyes in the photo, to get some idea of its emotions.</td>', 'This is a pretty nice shot. I get a subtle mix of emotion from this rider, love but also some fear, like the horse might be skittish and the rider is worried it''ll do something unpredictable. If I had one constructive comment, it''d have been to include the horses eyes in the photo, to get some idea of its emotions.', '2012-01-30 08:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658668, 996024, 142833, '<td valign="top">A sweet photo, the cat looks happy. :) <br/> <br/>Perhaps up the exposure a bit, or set it for the cat''s fur? I''d have liked to see more clearly the details of its coloration.</td>', 'A sweet photo, the cat looks happy. :)  Perhaps up the exposure a bit, or set it for the cat''s fur? I''d have liked to see more clearly the details of its coloration.', '2012-01-30 08:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658669, 995939, 142833, '<td valign="top">Funny and disgusting at the same time, which I suspect is what you were going for. Definitely provokes a response, from me, anyway.</td>', 'Funny and disgusting at the same time, which I suspect is what you were going for. Definitely provokes a response, from me, anyway.', '2012-01-30 08:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658670, 996012, 142833, '<td valign="top">Great textures on the lizard.<br/> <br/>I wonder how this would''ve looked in color, with more of the lizard in the frame. Perhaps lizard in the foreground and frightened human in the background?</td>', 'Great textures on the lizard. I wonder how this would''ve looked in color, with more of the lizard in the frame. Perhaps lizard in the foreground and frightened human in the background?', '2012-01-30 08:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658671, 995835, 142833, '<td valign="top">I love the mix of seriousness in the man''s expression combined with the absurdity of a cat in a dress. :) Bonus points for naming the cat after an Ancient Egyptian Pharaoh.</td>', 'I love the mix of seriousness in the man''s expression combined with the absurdity of a cat in a dress. :) Bonus points for naming the cat after an Ancient Egyptian Pharaoh.', '2012-01-30 08:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658675, 996010, 142833, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of location for this photo. The beach is a great place to show a bond between human and human''s best friend. <br/> <br/>I did find myself wanting to see more emotion between the dog and the woman, and wanting this photo to be in color as opposed to black and white.</td>', 'I like the choice of location for this photo. The beach is a great place to show a bond between human and human''s best friend.  I did find myself wanting to see more emotion between the dog and the woman, and wanting this photo to be in color as opposed to black and white.', '2012-01-30 08:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658678, 995615, 142833, '<td valign="top">I love the way the cat appears to be hugging its owner while staring into the camera. Pay that cat top dollar, cause he/she knows how to pose for the camera :) The black and white work beautifully here. Very nice composition. <br/> <br/>I''d have perhaps like''d a slightly less white background.</td>', 'I love the way the cat appears to be hugging its owner while staring into the camera. Pay that cat top dollar, cause he/she knows how to pose for the camera :) The black and white work beautifully here. Very nice composition.  I''d have perhaps like''d a slightly less white background.', '2012-01-30 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658679, 995839, 142833, '<td valign="top">Love the cat''s singular focus on that piece of tuna. :)</td>', 'Love the cat''s singular focus on that piece of tuna. :)', '2012-01-30 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658682, 995687, 142833, '<td valign="top">A nice, clean photo. <br/> <br/>I think I''d have liked to see the girl a bit closer to the puppies, with all three filling up the frame more.</td>', 'A nice, clean photo.  I think I''d have liked to see the girl a bit closer to the puppies, with all three filling up the frame more.', '2012-01-30 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658683, 995308, 142833, '<td valign="top">Well done, this photo shows emotion from both the human and the pet which is what I feel is a key element to this challenge.</td>', 'Well done, this photo shows emotion from both the human and the pet which is what I feel is a key element to this challenge.', '2012-01-30 08:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658685, 995631, 142833, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I completely buy the title in relation to the photo. The perspective of the photo works well to convey the sense that this dog IS a protector.</td>', 'Nicely done, I completely buy the title in relation to the photo. The perspective of the photo works well to convey the sense that this dog IS a protector.', '2012-01-30 08:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658686, 995759, 142833, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in the light and shadows. The dog on the left looks a little bit like he is being pulled along by his owner due to the bunching of the skin around the collar. I''m not sure if that conveys the emotion you were going for.</td>', 'Nice contrast in the light and shadows. The dog on the left looks a little bit like he is being pulled along by his owner due to the bunching of the skin around the collar. I''m not sure if that conveys the emotion you were going for.', '2012-01-30 08:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658687, 995460, 142833, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The man''s expression is perfect here, and the dog looks like he/she is smiling. :) I can''t think of a single thing I''d do to make this photo any better.</td>', 'Very nicely done. The man''s expression is perfect here, and the dog looks like he/she is smiling. :) I can''t think of a single thing I''d do to make this photo any better.', '2012-01-30 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658688, 995969, 142833, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the slightly hazy/dreamy quality it has.</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the slightly hazy/dreamy quality it has.', '2012-01-30 08:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658691, 995355, 142833, '<td valign="top">The composition and poses of this photo are great, but the over-exposure really detracts. I love how the cats tail curls around the finger and the whole up-close snuggle. I''d have given this photo a very high rating if it weren''t for the way it was exposed.</td>', 'The composition and poses of this photo are great, but the over-exposure really detracts. I love how the cats tail curls around the finger and the whole up-close snuggle. I''d have given this photo a very high rating if it weren''t for the way it was exposed.', '2012-01-30 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658710, 995355, 142816, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key.  I think the blur/out-of-focus works nicely here.</td>', 'Beautiful high key.  I think the blur/out-of-focus works nicely here.', '2012-01-30 09:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
