(6658736, 995589, 142833, '<td valign="top">I like the intimacy between horse and human here.<br/> <br/>I wonder how this would''ve looked with a lower ISO, seems a little grainy. Not sure if that is good or bad, though.</td>', 'I like the intimacy between horse and human here. I wonder how this would''ve looked with a lower ISO, seems a little grainy. Not sure if that is good or bad, though.', '2012-01-30 09:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658743, 995979, 142833, '<td valign="top">I like what this photo shoots for here. I''m not sure what is in the man''s mouth here, I''m guessing a biscuit? It is a nice way to get the dog to do a ''nose-kiss'' but at the same time, it does convey the sense that the dog is ''just in it for the biscuit''.</td>', 'I like what this photo shoots for here. I''m not sure what is in the man''s mouth here, I''m guessing a biscuit? It is a nice way to get the dog to do a ''nose-kiss'' but at the same time, it does convey the sense that the dog is ''just in it for the biscuit''.', '2012-01-30 09:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658746, 996023, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome open air feel. Great deaign elements.</td>', 'Awesome open air feel. Great deaign elements.', '2012-01-30 09:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658747, 996011, 142833, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I wonder if it would''ve been enhanced with a lower f-stop to blur the background more, as it is unremarkable. I might have asked the girl for bit of a ''gentler'' nose kiss here, so here face wouldn''t appear smushed.</td>', 'Nice photo. I wonder if it would''ve been enhanced with a lower f-stop to blur the background more, as it is unremarkable. I might have asked the girl for bit of a ''gentler'' nose kiss here, so here face wouldn''t appear smushed.', '2012-01-30 09:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658753, 995959, 142833, '<td valign="top">A nice photo. I wonder how this would''ve turned out with a dark background.</td>', 'A nice photo. I wonder how this would''ve turned out with a dark background.', '2012-01-30 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658755, 995483, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s me and my baby. ^_^ Good luck with this one baby, love it, really shows how affectionate she can be.</td>', 'It''s me and my baby. ^_^ Good luck with this one baby, love it, really shows how affectionate she can be.', '2012-01-30 10:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658765, 995871, 94265, '<td valign="top">Contrast is kinda dark for me (some light caught in their eyes would have been good) and the image is a bit soft, your strongest focus seems to be in the boy''s sleeve for some reason. It''s a lovely dog and a sweet moment though.</td>', 'Contrast is kinda dark for me (some light caught in their eyes would have been good) and the image is a bit soft, your strongest focus seems to be in the boy''s sleeve for some reason. It''s a lovely dog and a sweet moment though.', '2012-01-30 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
