(6658768, 995619, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very humorous, nice focus and an absolutely stunning dalmatian! Not too keen on the vignette but otherwise, a good job.</td>', 'Very humorous, nice focus and an absolutely stunning dalmatian! Not too keen on the vignette but otherwise, a good job.', '2012-01-30 10:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658769, 996014, 41129, '<td valign="top">good idea for the challenge, its just a shame that the focus seems to be more on the back trees than the dogs (which are lovely dogs btw)</td>', 'good idea for the challenge, its just a shame that the focus seems to be more on the back trees than the dogs (which are lovely dogs btw)', '2012-01-30 10:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658771, 995117, 41129, '<td valign="top">Strange choice of title as the hydrant is behind them and is clearly blocked from the dogs view by the woman and her bag.. doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Strange choice of title as the hydrant is behind them and is clearly blocked from the dogs view by the woman and her bag.. doesn''t work for me.', '2012-01-30 10:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658774, 995754, 41129, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog, nice focus on the dogs face.. bit noisy but kinda works with the colour tones for me.</td>', 'Lovely dog, nice focus on the dogs face.. bit noisy but kinda works with the colour tones for me.', '2012-01-30 10:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658775, 995832, 41129, '<td valign="top">No actual animals in the shot, very out of focus, no affection captured.. sorry but i just don''t get it lol</td>', 'No actual animals in the shot, very out of focus, no affection captured.. sorry but i just don''t get it lol', '2012-01-30 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658778, 995631, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and DOF, lovely dog! Good focus on him/her, I like the title too; nice idea, the faithful friend sitting happily at its owner''s feet.</td>', 'Nice angle and DOF, lovely dog! Good focus on him/her, I like the title too; nice idea, the faithful friend sitting happily at its owner''s feet.', '2012-01-30 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658779, 995970, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a bit of a snapshot really, composition is lacking and could do with the contrast being boosted. I also don''t feel any affection here, the woman almost looks cross with the dog (which is very cute by the way.) A smile from her and a less close-in crop would have helped this shot.</td>', 'This is a bit of a snapshot really, composition is lacking and could do with the contrast being boosted. I also don''t feel any affection here, the woman almost looks cross with the dog (which is very cute by the way.) A smile from her and a less close-in crop would have helped this shot.', '2012-01-30 10:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658780, 995961, 94265, '<td valign="top">That is one surprised-looking kitty, haha. Lovely cat, great focus, nice happy owner bokehd behind. I don''t like the border personally as I don''t think it''s needed.</td>', 'That is one surprised-looking kitty, haha. Lovely cat, great focus, nice happy owner bokehd behind. I don''t like the border personally as I don''t think it''s needed.', '2012-01-30 10:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658781, 995227, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the dead space in the top left, plus I''m not keen on where the crop ends on the woman''s chin; I think a different composition would have helped this for me. Perhaps a landscape orientation with a bit more symmetry; I feel it''s not quite working, seeing so much of the dog''s face with such a sharp cut-off on hers. Lovely dog though, cute scene and a nice effort.</td>', 'Not sure about the dead space in the top left, plus I''m not keen on where the crop ends on the woman''s chin; I think a different composition would have helped this for me. Perhaps a landscape orientation with a bit more symmetry; I feel it''s not quite working, seeing so much of the dog''s face with such a sharp cut-off on hers. Lovely dog though, cute scene and a nice effort.', '2012-01-30 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658782, 995831, 94265, '<td valign="top">It bothers me that the girl''s hand that''s stroking the horse is out of focus, I''d have waited until her hand was still to take the shot (or asked her to hold the pose.) Her expression is a bit strange too, it doesn''t quite say affection, she almost looks nervous; or possibly very cold! The composition and exposure are fine, the horse is a lovely colour and a nice contrast to the blue of her clothes.</td>', 'It bothers me that the girl''s hand that''s stroking the horse is out of focus, I''d have waited until her hand was still to take the shot (or asked her to hold the pose.) Her expression is a bit strange too, it doesn''t quite say affection, she almost looks nervous; or possibly very cold! The composition and exposure are fine, the horse is a lovely colour and a nice contrast to the blue of her clothes.', '2012-01-30 10:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658783, 995686, 94265, '<td valign="top">I expect this will be DQd for using expert editing. A good idea but more than a little creepy!</td>', 'I expect this will be DQd for using expert editing. A good idea but more than a little creepy!', '2012-01-30 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658784, 995810, 41129, '<td valign="top">Focus isn''t great on this.. nice idea though</td>', 'Focus isn''t great on this.. nice idea though', '2012-01-30 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658786, 995939, 94265, '<td valign="top">This made me chuckle. Nice clear focus, a good idea for the challenge, a very pretty kitty. I''m not a fan of sepia personally though, simply b&amp;w or colour would have made this better for me.</td>', 'This made me chuckle. Nice clear focus, a good idea for the challenge, a very pretty kitty. I''m not a fan of sepia personally though, simply b&w or colour would have made this better for me.', '2012-01-30 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658787, 996011, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a handsome horse. He looks like he''s being watchful of her while also enjoying the kiss. Sky is a bit blown out but it''s a nice image and well-focused.</td>', 'What a handsome horse. He looks like he''s being watchful of her while also enjoying the kiss. Sky is a bit blown out but it''s a nice image and well-focused.', '2012-01-30 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658788, 995832, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make out what''s going on here, lol. Is that a mural on the floor? It almost looks like a projection. I don''t think I''m crazy about this one, the title doesn''t help me connect and there doesn''t seem to be any affection captured. Shame the girl isn''t in focus.</td>', 'I can''t quite make out what''s going on here, lol. Is that a mural on the floor? It almost looks like a projection. I don''t think I''m crazy about this one, the title doesn''t help me connect and there doesn''t seem to be any affection captured. Shame the girl isn''t in focus.', '2012-01-30 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658789, 995831, 41129, '<td valign="top">The title sugests our eyes should goto the horses nose where we are met with the only out of focus part of the picture, the hand touching the nose.. kinda wastes it for me.</td>', 'The title sugests our eyes should goto the horses nose where we are met with the only out of focus part of the picture, the hand touching the nose.. kinda wastes it for me.', '2012-01-30 10:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
