(6658805, 995993, 41129, '<td valign="top">great shot, lovely dog</td>', 'great shot, lovely dog', '2012-01-30 10:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658806, 996023, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is amusing and in good focus but there are quite a few flaws that spoil it for me; the sky is pretty noisy, the compositon is generally Ok but the perspective makes me want to look away down the road, where there is no point of interest. The blown-out patch on the dog''s head is very strong too, it obscures the face which is a shame. This is something all dogs love to do which is nice but I don''t feel it particularly portrays affection.</td>', 'This is amusing and in good focus but there are quite a few flaws that spoil it for me; the sky is pretty noisy, the compositon is generally Ok but the perspective makes me want to look away down the road, where there is no point of interest. The blown-out patch on the dog''s head is very strong too, it obscures the face which is a shame. This is something all dogs love to do which is nice but I don''t feel it particularly portrays affection.', '2012-01-30 11:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658809, 996021, 41129, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the picture quality is great and the crop is too close in for a good composition for me... but even with that I like the picture lol.. the dogs expression is great lol</td>', 'I don''t think the picture quality is great and the crop is too close in for a good composition for me... but even with that I like the picture lol.. the dogs expression is great lol', '2012-01-30 11:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658813, 994713, 41129, '<td valign="top">really??? in a photography competition??? , sorry for being so blunt but this just doesn''t work on any level imaginable.</td>', 'really??? in a photography competition??? , sorry for being so blunt but this just doesn''t work on any level imaginable.', '2012-01-30 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658816, 996010, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is a dilemma for me.  It''s a very beautiful image, poignant and well composed.  I don''t see any artistic value in the extreme pixelation in the sky.  For the sheer awesomeness of the image underneath, I''ll give you a 7.</td>', 'This is a dilemma for me.  It''s a very beautiful image, poignant and well composed.  I don''t see any artistic value in the extreme pixelation in the sky.  For the sheer awesomeness of the image underneath, I''ll give you a 7.', '2012-01-30 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658817, 995160, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the high-key look, a tad grainy too but the image is funny, I like the composition, nice focus on the parrot''s face. African Grey? At first I thought the affection aspect was a stretch but I know the temperament of birds and if it wasn''t happy to perch on the guy''s head or it didn''t like him, you would not be able to get it to sit there, haha. I think this will place lower than it should.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the high-key look, a tad grainy too but the image is funny, I like the composition, nice focus on the parrot''s face. African Grey? At first I thought the affection aspect was a stretch but I know the temperament of birds and if it wasn''t happy to perch on the guy''s head or it didn''t like him, you would not be able to get it to sit there, haha. I think this will place lower than it should.', '2012-01-30 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658819, 995847, 41129, '<td valign="top">I recognise those manly hands.. and our lovely Dione of course hehe. Very well taken shot and works so well in b/w.</td>', 'I recognise those manly hands.. and our lovely Dione of course hehe. Very well taken shot and works so well in b/w.', '2012-01-30 11:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658820, 995460, 41129, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the dog looks so comfortable to be held and the guy has a nice kind look on his face.. very nicely taken and sharp focus too.. well done, a 9 from me :)</td>', 'I really like this, the dog looks so comfortable to be held and the guy has a nice kind look on his face.. very nicely taken and sharp focus too.. well done, a 9 from me :)', '2012-01-30 11:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658833, 995993, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ribbon winner to me!</td>', 'Looks like a ribbon winner to me!', '2012-01-30 11:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658836, 995477, 94265, '<td valign="top">I had to bite my lip looking at this early this morning to prevent a high-pitched squee of joy in case I woke my fella, haha. That pup is just the cutest thing, what an expressive face! Nice set-up too. Light on the woman''s right side is perhaps a little bright compared to the rest of her but the light on the puppy is perfect. SQUEEEE. *Steals it.*</td>', 'I had to bite my lip looking at this early this morning to prevent a high-pitched squee of joy in case I woke my fella, haha. That pup is just the cutest thing, what an expressive face! Nice set-up too. Light on the woman''s right side is perhaps a little bright compared to the rest of her but the light on the puppy is perfect. SQUEEEE. *Steals it.*', '2012-01-30 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658839, 995308, 94265, '<td valign="top">Skin tones look a little peachy, perhaps a cooling filter or slight adjustment in colour balance would have helped; are you a Nikon user? I sometimes feel I get the same strong peachy hue on skin when shooting indoors with my D3100. I like the shot overall, it''s really sweet and I absolutely love those dogs! I don''t feel a book about them was necessary personally, seems like odd bedtime reading to me and therfore less believeable but composition and exposure are good, plus it''s giving kisses! Haha.</td>', 'Skin tones look a little peachy, perhaps a cooling filter or slight adjustment in colour balance would have helped; are you a Nikon user? I sometimes feel I get the same strong peachy hue on skin when shooting indoors with my D3100. I like the shot overall, it''s really sweet and I absolutely love those dogs! I don''t feel a book about them was necessary personally, seems like odd bedtime reading to me and therfore less believeable but composition and exposure are good, plus it''s giving kisses! Haha.', '2012-01-30 11:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658846, 995718, 94265, '<td valign="top">Part of me likes the moodiness of this shot but part of me doesn''t like the fact that both the boy and dog''s faces are in darkness; I find it hard to connect the affection here when I can''t see any expressions. I also don''t think the vignette is needed since you have the thick black border. Nice silhouettes though and it held my attention regardless of my reservation.</td>', 'Part of me likes the moodiness of this shot but part of me doesn''t like the fact that both the boy and dog''s faces are in darkness; I find it hard to connect the affection here when I can''t see any expressions. I also don''t think the vignette is needed since you have the thick black border. Nice silhouettes though and it held my attention regardless of my reservation.', '2012-01-30 11:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658847, 996010, 94265, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really nice image, composition is Ok, lovely doggy but the quality on the sky is shocking; soooo pixellated, kills what chance the image had. The woman''s white clothing is very blown-out too. Shame, as I say I think this had the potential to be really nice.</td>', 'This could have been a really nice image, composition is Ok, lovely doggy but the quality on the sky is shocking; soooo pixellated, kills what chance the image had. The woman''s white clothing is very blown-out too. Shame, as I say I think this had the potential to be really nice.', '2012-01-30 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658848, 995801, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think a working animal has a different type of affection for it''s owner than a regular pet, not to say that a ''pet'' pet doesn''t trust it''s owner implicitly but an animal that works alongside it''s owner has a different relationship, another level of trust and they become very in-sync. This is a lovely example. Beautiful horse; a bright shot with clear focus and nice colours. I do wish the fellow''s feet weren''t cropped off but I''m a stickler for chopped hands/fingertips/feet/toes. Very good overall, best of luck!</td>', 'I think a working animal has a different type of affection for it''s owner than a regular pet, not to say that a ''pet'' pet doesn''t trust it''s owner implicitly but an animal that works alongside it''s owner has a different relationship, another level of trust and they become very in-sync. This is a lovely example. Beautiful horse; a bright shot with clear focus and nice colours. I do wish the fellow''s feet weren''t cropped off but I''m a stickler for chopped hands/fingertips/feet/toes. Very good overall, best of luck!', '2012-01-30 11:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658852, 995117, 143086, '<td valign="top">cool photo. A bit more contrasty than I''d like. I like how the upper 2/3 is dominated by verticals, and the lower is horizontal.</td>', 'cool photo. A bit more contrasty than I''d like. I like how the upper 2/3 is dominated by verticals, and the lower is horizontal.', '2012-01-30 11:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658853, 995967, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure wild seagulls don''t count as pets and I''m even more sure that they don''t feel any affection for him. Lots of details are lost in the blown highlights and there''s not much focus from what I can make out. A low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Pretty sure wild seagulls don''t count as pets and I''m even more sure that they don''t feel any affection for him. Lots of details are lost in the blown highlights and there''s not much focus from what I can make out. A low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.', '2012-01-30 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658855, 995615, 143086, '<td valign="top">it''s like the cat is saying "please, don''t go!"</td>', 'it''s like the cat is saying "please, don''t go!"', '2012-01-30 11:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658856, 995810, 143086, '<td valign="top">cute idea.</td>', 'cute idea.', '2012-01-30 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658857, 995959, 143086, '<td valign="top">gosh darn it that''s cute</td>', 'gosh darn it that''s cute', '2012-01-30 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658858, 995460, 94265, '<td valign="top">The dog looks so relaxed and happy! What a lovely shot. This has a lot of character, a nice friendly face on the chap and the dog is a cutie.  Nice b&amp;w conversion, great focus and crisply sharp. Way to go, good luck!</td>', 'The dog looks so relaxed and happy! What a lovely shot. This has a lot of character, a nice friendly face on the chap and the dog is a cutie.  Nice b&w conversion, great focus and crisply sharp. Way to go, good luck!', '2012-01-30 11:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658861, 995483, 143086, '<td valign="top">technically very good. I''m not getting much of a warm and fuzzy off of  it though</td>', 'technically very good. I''m not getting much of a warm and fuzzy off of  it though', '2012-01-30 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658864, 996026, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally approve of the use of animals in a circus (that''s what this looks like, my apologies if I''m mistaken) but that aside, the shot isn''t very good quality in general; nothing is in clear focus, it''s quite noisy, most of the details have been lost through movement and the blown highlights. The motion is a little bit interesting but this is a low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'I don''t personally approve of the use of animals in a circus (that''s what this looks like, my apologies if I''m mistaken) but that aside, the shot isn''t very good quality in general; nothing is in clear focus, it''s quite noisy, most of the details have been lost through movement and the blown highlights. The motion is a little bit interesting but this is a low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.', '2012-01-30 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658865, 995163, 143086, '<td valign="top">I love goats! Seriously...when I bring the kids to the petting zoo I''m more excited than they are  lol<br/> <br/>I think its a pretty decent pic, though a bit heavy on the vignetting IMO. I''m not getting much emotion from it though, like, it could be just any goat in any field.</td>', 'I love goats! Seriously...when I bring the kids to the petting zoo I''m more excited than they are  lol I think its a pretty decent pic, though a bit heavy on the vignetting IMO. I''m not getting much emotion from it though, like, it could be just any goat in any field.', '2012-01-30 11:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658867, 995983, 143086, '<td valign="top">This cat is saying: You''ll stay away if you know what''s good for you -- he''s mine!</td>', 'This cat is saying: You''ll stay away if you know what''s good for you -- he''s mine!', '2012-01-30 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658872, 995710, 143086, '<td valign="top">nice picture. A bit too much vignetting for me.</td>', 'nice picture. A bit too much vignetting for me.', '2012-01-30 11:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658873, 995835, 143086, '<td valign="top">This cat looks pissed off!!</td>', 'This cat looks pissed off!!', '2012-01-30 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
