(6658877, 995754, 143086, '<td valign="top">dof is nice, and the tone is nice too. Those circle things are wierd though, and pooch seems to be looking at them. But, why?</td>', 'dof is nice, and the tone is nice too. Those circle things are wierd though, and pooch seems to be looking at them. But, why?', '2012-01-30 11:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
