(6658884, 995710, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture, gorgeous coat on the dog. A playful dog during stick-throwing time is indeed a loving creature! Great focus, very nice job overall.</td>', 'Brilliant capture, gorgeous coat on the dog. A playful dog during stick-throwing time is indeed a loving creature! Great focus, very nice job overall.', '2012-01-30 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
