(6658887, 995839, 94265, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful and intense eyes, a stunning cat; love the shallow DOF in this shot and the focus on the cat''s face is great. I don''t like the border though, I think it detracts from the image. Good title.</td>', 'Such beautiful and intense eyes, a stunning cat; love the shallow DOF in this shot and the focus on the cat''s face is great. I don''t like the border though, I think it detracts from the image. Good title.', '2012-01-30 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6658890, 995993, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, fantastic focus, the dog looks absolutely in love with her. Great exposure and composition. A ribbon winner perhaps?</td>', 'Lovely shot, fantastic focus, the dog looks absolutely in love with her. Great exposure and composition. A ribbon winner perhaps?', '2012-01-30 11:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
