(6661938, 996024, 137576, '<td valign="top">kissing a cat goodnight = can you see the look of distain on my face :(, so that aside, its underexposed, dull and lacks any interest for me. id have liked to see more dynamic lighting more detail in the fur and the cats eyes open and catchlit if possible. the white dressing gown draws the eye to it.</td>', 'kissing a cat goodnight = can you see the look of distain on my face :(, so that aside, its underexposed, dull and lacks any interest for me. id have liked to see more dynamic lighting more detail in the fur and the cats eyes open and catchlit if possible. the white dressing gown draws the eye to it.', '2012-02-02 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
