(6664365, 995863, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awwww!!!  It''s a special child who can gain the trust of a rabbit.</td>', 'Awwww!!!  It''s a special child who can gain the trust of a rabbit.', '2012-02-05 10:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664366, 995861, 118154, '<td valign="top">Classic type of shot,should get on well.Although for me there is no affection shown here.</td>', 'Classic type of shot,should get on well.Although for me there is no affection shown here.', '2012-02-05 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664367, 995993, 118154, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge nice in my opinion.</td>', 'Fits the challenge nice in my opinion.', '2012-02-05 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664368, 995934, 65234, '<td valign="top">They do, and they snuggle, too.  I rather like rats.  I might like this better with a simpler or blurrier background and maybe softer light.  Not really a harsh moment in my mind (since I''ve met some very nice rats over the years) so the light doesn''t suit the mood I imagine.</td>', 'They do, and they snuggle, too.  I rather like rats.  I might like this better with a simpler or blurrier background and maybe softer light.  Not really a harsh moment in my mind (since I''ve met some very nice rats over the years) so the light doesn''t suit the mood I imagine.', '2012-02-05 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664370, 995832, 118154, '<td valign="top">Strange and not sure it really fits but I like looking at it.</td>', 'Strange and not sure it really fits but I like looking at it.', '2012-02-05 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664372, 995686, 118154, '<td valign="top">My wife shrieked and cried turn that off when she saw this.I like it and it sure is close.</td>', 'My wife shrieked and cried turn that off when she saw this.I like it and it sure is close.', '2012-02-05 10:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664374, 995843, 118154, '<td valign="top">Cute and real.</td>', 'Cute and real.', '2012-02-05 10:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664375, 995861, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ears up and everything; nicely done!  Not the most emotive image in the challenge to me, maybe because it is so technically perfect.  And posed.  Gotta'' admit I have a bias for unscripted emotion between pets and people (and no, my profile pic is not my favorite shot of me and my dog &lt;g&gt;).  But this is beautiful.  And if I were that dog''s person I''d be over the moon to have something like this to hang on my wall.</td>', 'Ears up and everything; nicely done!  Not the most emotive image in the challenge to me, maybe because it is so technically perfect.  And posed.  Gotta'' admit I have a bias for unscripted emotion between pets and people (and no, my profile pic is not my favorite shot of me and my dog <g>).  But this is beautiful.  And if I were that dog''s person I''d be over the moon to have something like this to hang on my wall.', '2012-02-05 10:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664376, 995718, 118154, '<td valign="top">Firmly reminds me of film,love the dark as well as the light.</td>', 'Firmly reminds me of film,love the dark as well as the light.', '2012-02-05 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664377, 995954, 65234, '<td valign="top">Have to admit, as a volunteer at the animal shelter I meet a LOT of people who really should have a pet like this!  I''d find this shot a little more appealing with softer light, I think, like a more dreamy portrait.</td>', 'Have to admit, as a volunteer at the animal shelter I meet a LOT of people who really should have a pet like this!  I''d find this shot a little more appealing with softer light, I think, like a more dreamy portrait.', '2012-02-05 10:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664380, 995871, 65234, '<td valign="top">The child''s expression and body language are wonderful, and I like the lowkey light.  Can''t make up my mind about whether I''d like the dog in focus or not ... usually I would, but this way s/he seems more stoic somehow, and there''s emotion hinted at between the dog and the photographer (who presumably can rescue the dog from the child''s grasp with a word).</td>', 'The child''s expression and body language are wonderful, and I like the lowkey light.  Can''t make up my mind about whether I''d like the dog in focus or not ... usually I would, but this way s/he seems more stoic somehow, and there''s emotion hinted at between the dog and the photographer (who presumably can rescue the dog from the child''s grasp with a word).', '2012-02-05 10:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664381, 996034, 118154, '<td valign="top">Must be hard to tell(who,s who) when they are apart.Lovely couple</td>', 'Must be hard to tell(who,s who) when they are apart.Lovely couple', '2012-02-05 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664382, 995710, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  A classic capture of the age-old human/dog game.</td>', 'Nice!  A classic capture of the age-old human/dog game.', '2012-02-05 10:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664383, 995979, 118154, '<td valign="top">Is that tongue or biccie ?</td>', 'Is that tongue or biccie ?', '2012-02-05 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664384, 995843, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG that''s simply adorable!  Great light ... just magical :-)  And I love Mama Cat supervising the interaction.</td>', 'OMG that''s simply adorable!  Great light ... just magical :-)  And I love Mama Cat supervising the interaction.', '2012-02-05 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6664385, 996023, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  That''s probably not safe for either of you, but it''s cute ;-)</td>', 'LOL!  That''s probably not safe for either of you, but it''s cute ;-)', '2012-02-05 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
