e expression of animals as those in the challenge before this. Sorry!!!! Regards, Alex. Thanks all so much for your comments and advice. There is kid running around, I avoid her in this shot :-( .  Top 5 winners all in B&W. All are amazingly capture and awesome, my big congratulations!! Below is an entry from  jjbeguin, this entry is so lovely. Well done!', '2012-02-06 01:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
