(6664975, 995160, 13822, '<td valign="top">well just to let you know that there is so much love going on in that photo, I knew it would probably be hard for people not used to birds to see. It is obvious for a bird person that this bird is smiling (you can see it in his eyes), he is really happy to have made it to my husbands head and the best part getting to stay! Because he is not allowed to stay on heads but my husband was fast asleep :)</td>', 'well just to let you know that there is so much love going on in that photo, I knew it would probably be hard for people not used to birds to see. It is obvious for a bird person that this bird is smiling (you can see it in his eyes), he is really happy to have made it to my husbands head and the best part getting to stay! Because he is not allowed to stay on heads but my husband was fast asleep :)', '2012-02-06 04:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
