(6665536, 995686, 142483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddhead:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot... hate it when people vote low because they think you "cheated". </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Can''t assume thats the only reason for low votes. In a general sense, I like the pic, it''s interesting. But I voted it as one of my lower scores because, in my opinion, it didn''t show any emotion between the pet and owner. It''s a funny shot, but it doesn''t speak to me like the majority of the other shots did.<br/> <br/>ETA: Note, this wasn''t my lowest scoring shot, but it was below average on my score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-06 20:07:30.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by toddhead: Great shot... hate it when people vote low because they think you "cheated".   Can''t assume thats the only reason for low votes. In a general sense, I like the pic, it''s interesting. But I voted it as one of my lower scores because, in my opinion, it didn''t show any emotion between the pet and owner. It''s a funny shot, but it doesn''t speak to me like the majority of the other shots did. ETA: Note, this wasn''t my lowest scoring shot, but it was below average on my score.', '2012-02-06 19:24:23.000000', '2012-02-06 20:07:30.000000', 0),
