(6669962, 995842, 141409, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  There''s a lot of ways I could have cropped this.  I decided on this version (which is only a minor crop) since I liked the bokeh at the bottom and felt it added to the image.  Plus that bokeh cost me a small fortune and I still haven''t been forgiven by my other half!  The picture is of my dog Bodey and my partner Jane.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  There''s a lot of ways I could have cropped this.  I decided on this version (which is only a minor crop) since I liked the bokeh at the bottom and felt it added to the image.  Plus that bokeh cost me a small fortune and I still haven''t been forgiven by my other half!  The picture is of my dog Bodey and my partner Jane.', '2012-02-10 11:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6671423, 995687, 33068, '<td valign="top">She is so dang cute.   Great shot.</td>', 'She is so dang cute.   Great shot.', '2012-02-11 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6671957, 996023, 71167, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, conveying the love of wind in the hair for both of you! Can we see the horse photo? :-)</td>', 'Wonderful photo, conveying the love of wind in the hair for both of you! Can we see the horse photo? :-)', '2012-02-11 20:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6672711, 995983, 80096, '<td valign="top">Great portrait Jamie! It''s definitely top notch, your work is excellent!</td>', 'Great portrait Jamie! It''s definitely top notch, your work is excellent!', '2012-02-12 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6673384, 995832, 49773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mcaldo:</b></div><hr/><i> The shadow of the little girl makes me think of a girl''s face outline in profile, with the strangest hairdo..<br/>Excellent. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I had the exact same thoughts, and then I realized that''s a rabbit in her hair.</td>', 'Originally posted by mcaldo: The shadow of the little girl makes me think of a girl''s face outline in profile, with the strangest hairdo..Excellent.   I had the exact same thoughts, and then I realized that''s a rabbit in her hair.', '2012-02-12 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6680494, 996023, 20799, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe I didn''t comment on my top pick of this challenge. I completely disagree with some commenters, how can someone not see and feel the affection in this image?! Besides, I love it when such a strongly emotional photo appears and goes against all the orthodoxy of composition, light and whatnot... and yet conveys what it intended to. I wouldn''t have this any other way. Congrats on the well deserved score and PH!</td>', 'Can''t believe I didn''t comment on my top pick of this challenge. I completely disagree with some commenters, how can someone not see and feel the affection in this image?! Besides, I love it when such a strongly emotional photo appears and goes against all the orthodoxy of composition, light and whatnot... and yet conveys what it intended to. I wouldn''t have this any other way. Congrats on the well deserved score and PH!', '2012-02-17 02:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
